WEBVTT

00:06.965 --> 00:08.137
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.241 --> 00:10.034
<i>Aye-aye, Captain!</i>
<i>是的，队长！</i>

00:10.137 --> 00:11.344
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

00:11.448 --> 00:13.758
<i>Aye-aye, Captain!</i>
<i>是的，队长！</i>

00:13.862 --> 00:16.448
<i>♪ Oh ♪</i>
<i>♪哦♪</i>

00:16.551 --> 00:18.551
<i>♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪</i>
<i>♪谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪</i>

00:18.655 --> 00:20.551
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:20.655 --> 00:22.862
<i>♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪</i>
<i>♪ 吸水性、黄色
他是多孔的 ♪</i>

00:22.965 --> 00:24.413
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:24.517 --> 00:26.586
<i>♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪</i>

00:26.689 --> 00:28.034
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:28.137 --> 00:30.655
<i>♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪</i>
<i>♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪</i>

00:30.758 --> 00:32.551
<i>- ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
- Ready?</i>
<i>- ♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪
- 准备好了吗？</i>

00:32.655 --> 00:34.586
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:34.689 --> 00:36.827
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:36.931 --> 00:38.482
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:38.586 --> 00:41.100
<i>♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪</i>

00:45.655 --> 00:46.655
<i>Argh!</i>
<i>啊！</i>

01:01.206 --> 01:03.068
Huh?
啊？

01:03.172 --> 01:05.275
Ugh, I am so hungry
呃，我好饿

01:05.379 --> 01:08.344
and incapable of doing
anything for myself!
并且无能为力
为了自己什么都可以！

01:08.448 --> 01:10.310
You're in luck,
my slovenly friend!
你很幸运，
我的邋遢朋友！

01:10.413 --> 01:12.655
While you sit there
wallowing in your filth,
当你坐在那里时
沉溺于你的污秽之中，

01:12.758 --> 01:16.100
you can let the Krusty Krab make
and deliver your meal for ya!
你可以让蟹堡王做
并为您送餐！

01:17.103 --> 01:21.551
If your food isn't in your hands
in ten minutes or less,
如果你的食物不在你手中
在十分钟或更短的时间内，

01:21.655 --> 01:23.482
it's f-f-f...
这是 f-f-f...

01:24.275 --> 01:25.206
Pssst!
嘘！

01:25.310 --> 01:27.793
The line is,
"Free."
这条线是，
“免费。”

01:27.896 --> 01:29.241
Yeah, what he said.
是的，他说的。

01:40.100 --> 01:42.896
Thank you, Krusty Krab!
谢谢你，蟹堡王！

01:42.100 --> 01:44.379
You're welcome!
不客气！

01:44.482 --> 01:45.379
Where's me money?
我哪里有钱？

01:45.100 --> 01:48.482
<i>Little did they know
their Krusty commercial</i>
<i>他们知之甚少
他们的 Krusty 广告</i>

01:48.586 --> 01:51.275
<i>would reach
the ignoble eyes of...</i>
<i>将达到
卑鄙的眼睛……</i>

01:51.379 --> 01:54.068
<i>the League of E.V.I.L.!</i>
<i>邪恶联盟！</i>

01:54.172 --> 01:57.586
Mmm! I love those greasy
Krabby Patties!
嗯！我喜欢那些油腻的
蟹肉饼！

01:57.689 --> 02:01.172
Yeah, but I hate
paying for things!
是的，但我讨厌
付钱买东西！

02:01.275 --> 02:02.931
Well, if I don't get
好吧，如果我没有得到

02:03.034 --> 02:04.896
my afternoon snackies,
我的下午点心，

02:05.000 --> 02:08.517
I'm gonna throw a tantrum!
我要发脾气了！

02:11.551 --> 02:16.896
You're right! This calls for
a deliciously diabolical scheme.
你说得对！这需要
一个极其邪恶的计划

02:17.000 --> 02:18.172
Whoop!
哎哟！

02:18.275 --> 02:20.965
We place our order
with the Krusty Krab,
我们下订单
和蟹堡王一起，

02:21.068 --> 02:23.137
then use our powers of evil
然后使用我们的邪恶力量

02:23.241 --> 02:26.310
to ensure the delivery boy
is late!
确保送货员
迟到了！

02:26.413 --> 02:28.275
Then we get a free lunch!
然后我们就可以得到免费的午餐了！

02:30.448 --> 02:33.206
Laugh with me, villains! Laugh!
和我一起笑吧，恶棍们！笑！

02:37.275 --> 02:38.310
Shh, shh!
嘘，嘘！

02:38.413 --> 02:39.793
- <i>Krusty Krab!</i>
- Hello?
-<i>蟹堡王！</i>
- 你好？

02:39.896 --> 02:42.241
I'd like five Krabby Combos,
extra Krusty sauce...
我想要五个蟹蟹组合，
额外的Krusty酱...

02:42.344 --> 02:44.068
Hey!
嘿！

02:44.172 --> 02:47.172
Oh. Make that four and
a Pipsqueak Patty kid's meal.
哦。使这四个和
Pipsqueak Patty 儿童餐。

02:47.275 --> 02:50.344
Make it out to...
Man Ray!
让它出来...
曼·雷！

02:50.448 --> 02:51.896
Deliver to League of E.V.I.L.
secret hideout,
交付给 E.V.I.L. 联盟
秘密藏身处，

02:52.000 --> 02:54.137
Ominous Alley, behind
the gas station. Thank you!
不祥的小巷，后面
加油站。谢谢你！

02:54.241 --> 02:56.310
- <i>No, thank--</i>
- Villains!
- <i>不用了，谢谢--</i>
- 恶棍！

02:56.413 --> 02:58.137
Battle stations!
战斗站！

02:58.241 --> 02:59.862
<i>Meanwhile!</i>
<i>同时！</i>

02:59.965 --> 03:02.965
Now remember, SpongeBob,
this delivery's gotta be quick,
现在记住，海绵宝宝，
这次送货一定要快

03:03.068 --> 03:05.413
and you gotta put it directly
in the customer's hand.
你必须直接把它
在客户手中。

03:05.517 --> 03:07.413
I ain't givin' out
no free meals!
我不会放弃
没有免费餐！

03:07.517 --> 03:08.965
Aye-aye, sir!
是啊，先生！

03:09.068 --> 03:10.586
Uh, but...
呃，但是...

03:11.689 --> 03:13.206
Think I'll have time
for the villains
我想我会有时间
对于恶棍来说

03:13.310 --> 03:14.931
to sign my comic book?
签署我的漫画书？

03:15.655 --> 03:17.620
Just get in the cannon.
只要进入大炮即可。

03:18.827 --> 03:19.931
Whoosh!
嗖嗖！

03:22.172 --> 03:23.034
Pull!
拉！

03:25.931 --> 03:27.034
<i>Slam!</i>
<i>猛击！</i>

03:29.413 --> 03:30.793
Huh?
啊？

03:30.896 --> 03:34.379
"Secret entrance."
Sounds villainous!
“秘密入口。”
听起来很邪恶！

03:35.137 --> 03:36.724
This must be the place!
一定是这个地方！

03:38.827 --> 03:40.689
Huh?
啊？

03:42.655 --> 03:43.310
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

03:47.517 --> 03:49.724
- Oh. Wait a second.
- <i>Thinking quickly,</i>
- 哦。等一下。
- <i>快速思考，</i>

03:49.827 --> 03:52.551
<i>SpongeBob reached for
his hydrodynamic spatula</i>
<i>海绵宝宝伸手去拿
他的流体动力铲</i>

03:52.655 --> 03:54.724
<i>with port and starboard
attachments!</i>
<i>左舷和右舷
附件！</i>

03:58.206 --> 03:59.965
Eight minutes to spare!
还剩八分钟！

04:00.068 --> 04:01.965
This'll be a walk in the park.
这将是在公园散步。

04:02.068 --> 04:03.758
Eh... I mean, cave.
呃...我的意思是，洞穴。

04:09.344 --> 04:10.862
Whattaya want, bub?
小伙子想要什么？

04:10.965 --> 04:12.827
Krusty delivery!
库斯提送货！

04:12.931 --> 04:14.379
Hey, I know you!
嘿，我认识你！

04:14.482 --> 04:16.965
- You're...
- <i>Helen the Felon!</i>
- 你是...
- <i>重罪犯海伦！</i>

04:17.068 --> 04:19.310
<i>The trouble-making tyke!</i>
<i>这个惹麻烦的家伙！</i>

04:19.413 --> 04:20.482
That's right.
这是正确的。

04:20.586 --> 04:23.103
And I'm giving you a time-out!
我给你一个暂停时间！

04:23.206 --> 04:25.068
B-But I'm making a delivery!
但、但我正在送货！

04:25.172 --> 04:28.724
And Mr. Krabs says I have to
put it right in your hand!
蟹老板说我必须这么做
把它放在你的手里！

04:28.827 --> 04:30.793
Not my hand.
不是我的手。

04:30.896 --> 04:32.241
Man Ray's hand!
曼雷之手！

04:32.344 --> 04:35.310
You're gonna have to open this
door if you wanna get to him.
你必须打开这个
门，如果你想接近他。

04:36.379 --> 04:37.344
Okay!
好的！

04:37.448 --> 04:38.620
Huh?
啊？

04:39.482 --> 04:41.275
Yah!
啊！

04:46.000 --> 04:47.137
Whoa!
哇！

04:52.344 --> 04:54.724
Give up the bag,
buddy boy!
放弃包包，
伙计男孩！

04:54.827 --> 04:57.758
You'll never make it
to Man Ray on time!
你永远不会成功
准时到曼雷！

04:58.275 --> 04:59.379
Never!
绝不！

04:59.482 --> 05:03.862
Too weak to turn knob...
太弱了，无法转动旋钮...

05:03.965 --> 05:07.931
I'll use
my patty flipping hand!
我会用
我的小馅饼翻转手！

05:11.655 --> 05:15.000
Huh? No fair! That's cheatin'!
啊？不公平！那是作弊！

05:15.103 --> 05:17.586
Whoa!
哇！

05:18.344 --> 05:19.551
<i>Concussed!</i>
<i>脑震荡！</i>

05:19.655 --> 05:21.862
Sorry about that.
对此感到抱歉。

05:21.965 --> 05:23.517
Say, can I get your autograph?
说吧，我可以要你的签名吗？

05:23.620 --> 05:25.103
Of course!
当然！

05:28.896 --> 05:30.344
Gee, thanks!
哎呀，谢谢！

05:30.448 --> 05:32.620
Six minutes to spare.
还剩六分钟。

05:36.172 --> 05:38.241
Krusty delivery!
库斯提送货！

05:38.965 --> 05:39.862
Huh?
啊？

05:45.896 --> 05:48.620
I can't believe it! That's...
我简直不敢相信！那是...

05:48.724 --> 05:50.586
<i>Jumbo Shrimp!</i>
<i>大虾！</i>

05:50.689 --> 05:53.206
<i>The biggest name
in bad behavior!</i>
<i>最响亮的名字
行为不端！</i>

05:53.310 --> 05:57.724
And just where do you think
you're going, small fry?
你认为哪里
小鲜肉，你要去吗？

05:57.827 --> 06:01.655
K-Krusty delivery...
for Man Ray?
K-Krusty交付...
为了曼·雷？

06:01.758 --> 06:06.551
If you wanna get to him,
you'll have to go through me!
如果你想接近他，
你必须通过我！

06:09.034 --> 06:10.724
No! Please!
不！请！

06:10.827 --> 06:12.206
Huh?
啊？

06:13.793 --> 06:15.206
<i>Puny!</i>
<i>微不足道！</i>

06:15.310 --> 06:17.172
You look bigger in the comics.
你在漫画里看起来更大。

06:17.275 --> 06:19.137
Do you think you could
sign this for me?
你认为你可以吗
帮我签这个吗？

06:19.241 --> 06:20.517
Oh, gladly.
哦，很高兴。

06:20.620 --> 06:22.379
So, uh, you're a fan?
那么，呃，你是粉丝吗？

06:22.482 --> 06:24.862
Oh... Huge!
哦……巨大！

06:29.310 --> 06:30.379
Wait!
等待！

06:30.482 --> 06:32.793
I'm not done with you,
little guy!
我和你还没完
小家伙！

06:32.896 --> 06:35.137
Get back here!
回到这里！

06:35.586 --> 06:37.275
Four minutes!
Better hurry!
四分钟！
最好快点！

06:41.379 --> 06:42.793
Where am I?
我在哪里？

06:42.896 --> 06:45.965
I... must have taken
a wrong turn.
我……一定是拿走了
转错了方向。

06:49.965 --> 06:53.689
You certainly did,
you simpleminded sponge!
你当然做到了，
你这个头脑简单的海绵！

06:54.379 --> 06:56.724
Prepare to be ensnared by the--
准备好被——

06:56.827 --> 06:59.448
The Dirty Bubble! Ooh!
Can I get your autograph?
肮脏的泡泡！哦！
我可以得到你的签名吗？

06:59.551 --> 07:02.000
No! N-no, wait!
不！不、不，等等！

07:02.448 --> 07:04.103
- Not again!
- <i>Pop!</i>
- 不再有！
- <i>流行！</i>

07:06.655 --> 07:08.344
Dirty Bubble.
肮脏的泡泡。

07:08.448 --> 07:10.724
Hmm. Now where's Man Ray?
唔。现在曼·雷在哪里？

07:16.034 --> 07:18.482
Um...
嗯...

07:20.758 --> 07:22.655
K-Krusty d-delivery!
K-Krusty d-送货！

07:26.793 --> 07:28.931
Hmm?
唔？

07:33.689 --> 07:35.172
I should have known!
我早该知道的！

07:35.275 --> 07:39.793
It's, uh... It's, uh...
这是，呃……这是，呃……

07:40.275 --> 07:41.172
Eh?
呃？

07:41.275 --> 07:42.724
<i>Sub-Marinara!</i>
<i>潜艇！</i>

07:42.827 --> 07:45.275
<i>The maniacal meatball sub!</i>
<i>疯狂的肉丸子！</i>

07:45.379 --> 07:46.551
No matter.
不管。

07:46.655 --> 07:49.448
I could never be defeated
by food.
我永远不会被打败
通过食物。

07:49.551 --> 07:52.379
I am a... fry cook!
我是一名...炒菜厨师！

08:00.655 --> 08:02.103
<i>Saucy!</i>
<i>俏皮！</i>

08:08.724 --> 08:10.413
Oh!
哦！

08:10.517 --> 08:11.689
<i>Breaded!</i>
<i>面包屑！</i>

08:11.793 --> 08:12.827
Oh, no!
哦，不！

08:12.931 --> 08:16.034
I've been defeated by food!
我被食物打败了！

08:16.137 --> 08:19.379
<i>Oh, no! This sinister
spuccadella is preparing</i>
<i>哦，不！这险恶的
斯普卡德拉正在准备</i>

08:19.482 --> 08:23.344
<i>to marinate our hero
in his famous extra spicy</i>
<i>腌制我们的英雄
以他著名的特辣</i>

08:23.448 --> 08:25.793
<i>molten arrabbiata sauce!</i>
<i>融化的arrabbiata酱！</i>

08:25.896 --> 08:29.344
<i>How will SpongeBob escape
this harrowing hoagie?</i>
<i>海绵宝宝将如何逃脱
这个令人痛苦的三明治？</i>

08:29.448 --> 08:32.896
Oh, don't worry, Mr. Narrator,
I know what to do!
哦，别担心，旁白先生，
我知道该怎么做了！

08:33.000 --> 08:34.827
<i>Well, then do it!</i>
<i>好吧，那就开始吧！</i>

08:43.068 --> 08:45.793
Looks like I filled up on bread!
看来我吃面包已经饱了！

08:46.517 --> 08:49.034
Now to wrap up the leftovers.
现在把剩菜包起来。

08:55.655 --> 08:57.241
Will you sign this for me?
你愿意帮我签这个吗？

08:59.758 --> 09:01.724
Uh... thanks.
呃...谢谢。

09:03.724 --> 09:06.310
Looks like you've been
foiled again!
看来你已经
再次挫败！

09:07.620 --> 09:09.758
<i>Extra fresh!</i>
<i>特别新鲜！</i>

09:16.344 --> 09:18.586
While I wait
for my delivery,
当我等待时
为了我的交货，

09:18.689 --> 09:21.172
I might as well kill some time!
我还不如消磨点时间呢！

09:22.172 --> 09:24.241
<i>The Tremendous Trunk!</i>
<i>巨大的树干！</i>

09:24.344 --> 09:27.448
<i>The elephant seal
whose nose knows all!</i>
<i>象海豹
谁的鼻子知道一切！</i>

09:27.551 --> 09:29.689
Let me go, Man Ray!
放开我，曼雷！

09:29.793 --> 09:32.931
I've already sniffed out
your evil deeds!
我已经嗅出
你的恶行！

09:33.034 --> 09:35.482
The only thing
you'll be sniffing...
唯一的一件事
你会吸...

09:35.586 --> 09:37.931
is this stinky cheese!
这是臭奶酪吗！

09:38.034 --> 09:40.103
No! Not Limburger!
不！不是林堡！

09:40.206 --> 09:41.482
I have children!
我有孩子了！

09:44.034 --> 09:45.620
Krusty delivery!
库斯提送货！

09:45.724 --> 09:47.689
And with ten seconds to spare.
还有十秒钟的时间。

09:47.793 --> 09:49.827
Ooh, my lunch order.
哦，我的午餐订单。

09:49.931 --> 09:54.137
Well, go ahead
and put it in my hand.
好吧，继续吧
并把它放在我手里。

09:54.241 --> 09:55.310
Oops!
哎呀！

09:58.724 --> 10:01.275
Yes! Delivery complete!
是的！发货完成！

10:01.379 --> 10:03.310
Yes, but it was...
是的，但那是...

10:03.413 --> 10:05.689
one second late!
晚了一秒！

10:05.793 --> 10:07.100
<i>Overdue!</i>
<i>逾期了！</i>

10:10.724 --> 10:13.172
That means...
这意味着...

10:13.275 --> 10:15.310
...our meal...
...我们的饭菜...

10:15.413 --> 10:17.103
...is free!
...是免费的！

10:17.206 --> 10:19.034
Laugh at him, villains!
嘲笑他吧，恶棍们！

10:19.137 --> 10:20.310
Laugh!
笑！

10:25.448 --> 10:26.482
Hey, kid!
嘿，孩子！

10:26.586 --> 10:27.551
A little help here?
这里有一点帮助吗？

10:27.655 --> 10:29.344
Oh, hi, Tremendous Trunk.
哦，嗨，巨大的树干。

10:29.793 --> 10:31.620
Sure, I'll free you.
当然，我会释放你。

10:31.724 --> 10:32.724
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

10:33.379 --> 10:36.275
Can I have
your autograph?
我可以有
你的签名？

10:36.379 --> 10:37.517
Here you go!
干得好！

10:37.620 --> 10:42.310
But listen, pal, you helped me,
so I'll help you!
但是听着，朋友，你帮助了我，
所以我会帮助你！

10:42.413 --> 10:44.103
<i>With the prodigious power</i>
<i>拥有惊人的力量</i>

10:44.206 --> 10:46.137
<i>of his potent proboscis...</i>
<i>他强大的长鼻......</i>

10:46.241 --> 10:49.034
<i>...The Tremendous Trunk
sneezed SpongeBob</i>
<i>...巨大的树干
海绵宝宝打喷嚏</i>

10:49.137 --> 10:51.206
<i>back through time itself!</i>
<i>回到过去！</i>

10:51.310 --> 10:54.724
<i>One minute
and seven seconds earlier!</i>
<i>一分钟
七秒前！</i>

10:56.310 --> 10:57.448
Huh? Oof!
啊？钱币！

10:57.965 --> 11:00.896
Krusty delivery... delivered!
Krusty 交付...交付！

11:01.655 --> 11:02.100
Aw...
噢...

11:03.103 --> 11:06.275
- That'll be $12.
- Uh, well, you see...
- 那是 12 美元。
- 呃，好吧，你看...

11:06.379 --> 11:09.172
The League of E.V.I.L.
is actually broke.
E.V.I.L.联盟
实际上已经破产了。

11:09.275 --> 11:11.655
Turns out crime doesn't pay.
事实证明，犯罪是没有代价的。

11:11.758 --> 11:13.896
Oh. Well, that's okay.
哦。好吧，没关系。

11:14.000 --> 11:15.137
I'll cover it!
我来遮盖它！

11:18.413 --> 11:20.551
Ooh! Thanks for the tip!
哦！谢谢你的提示！

11:20.655 --> 11:21.965
Sign here, please.
请在这里签名。

11:26.862 --> 11:28.758
Thank you, evil villains!
谢谢你们，邪恶的恶棍！

11:28.862 --> 11:31.896
No! Thank you, SpongeBob!
不！谢谢你，海绵宝宝！

11:31.100 --> 11:33.100
Ah-choo!
啊呼！

11:36.965 --> 11:39.379
Gesundheit!
完全安全！

11:39.482 --> 11:40.827
Thanks.
谢谢。

11:40.931 --> 11:42.448
<i>End!</i>
<i>结束！</i>

<i>结束！</i>